# qa-pipeline environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in values as needed.
# `.env.local` is gitignored — never commit real secrets.
#
# Currently no env vars are required:
# - GitHub MCP server was removed (auxiliary, not used by the core pipeline).
# - Playwright MCP needs no credentials.
# - Future agent adapters (Claude Code, Codex) may require API keys here.

# Example for future use:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
